<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>When a good product stops turning into growth.</h2>
      <p>Here is what that looked like for one client.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case">
      <div class="case-figure">
        <div class="num">$35M <span>&rarr;</span> $90M</div>
        <div class="note">revenue, as reported by the client, over three years</div>
        <div class="growth-chart">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 260 132" role="img" aria-label="A revenue line rising from 35 million dollars in year zero to 90 million dollars in year three.">
            <line x1="10" y1="112" x2="250" y2="112" stroke="#E3E0D8" stroke-width="1"/>
            <polyline points="18,98 92,88 166,58 242,20" fill="none" stroke="#152238" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="18" cy="98" r="3.5" fill="#152238"/>
            <circle cx="242" cy="20" r="4.5" fill="#9C7A3C"/>
            <text x="18" y="128" font-family="Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#5C6472">Year 0 &middot; $35M</text>
            <text x="250" y="128" text-anchor="end" font-family="Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#5C6472">Year 3 &middot; $90M</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-body">
        <p><strong>The situation.</strong> An industrial manufacturer with a strong product and a large market &mdash; but revenue had settled at $35 million, and the team could not see the route past it.</p>
        <p><strong>What we did.</strong> Working alongside the team, we defined the real problem, found an underserved niche the company was well placed to win, and shaped a stretching but attainable target everyone could get behind.</p>
        <p><strong>What happened.</strong> Over the three years that followed, the company reported revenue of $90 million.</p>
        <p class="case-note">mab Partners guided the direction-setting; the team delivered the growth. Figures are the client&rsquo;s own.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case-hook">
      <p>If your product is strong but the growth number has stopped moving, that is the kind of problem we take on &mdash; starting from your situation, not a template.</p>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ site.calendly }}">Let&rsquo;s talk about yours</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

